#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:65
msgid "A one-way hash (SHA-256) of the facilitator recovery code. The code itself is shown to you once and is never stored — we keep only the hash so it can be checked, not recovered. Because it cannot be shown again, a facilitator can generate a replacement from room settings at any time. Doing so stores a new hash and stops the previous code working."
msgstr "A one-way hash (SHA-256) of the facilitator recovery code. The code itself is shown to you once and is never stored — we keep only the hash so it can be checked, not recovered. Because it cannot be shown again, a facilitator can generate a replacement from room settings at any time. Doing so stores a new hash and stops the previous code working."

