#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:26
msgid "Point Taken is a free, real-time planning-poker room for teams. It is built privacy-first: no accounts, no tracking, and no more data than a voting session actually needs. This page explains, in plain language, what is stored, what is not, and how to remove it."
msgstr "Point Taken is a free, real-time planning-poker room for teams. It is built privacy-first: no accounts, no tracking, and no more data than a voting session actually needs. This page explains, in plain language, what is stored, what is not, and how to remove it."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:213
msgid "Point Taken is free and has no ads or paid tiers. A small banner may invite you to support its upkeep by “buying me a coffee.” It is entirely optional and changes nothing about the app if you ignore or dismiss it — dismissing it just hides it for a week (see browser storage above). The link opens an external payment service (Buy Me a Coffee) in a new tab; no third-party scripts or trackers are loaded inside Point Taken itself, but once you follow that link you are on their site, subject to their own privacy practices."
msgstr "Point Taken is free and has no ads or paid tiers. A small banner may invite you to support its upkeep by “buying me a coffee.” It is entirely optional and changes nothing about the app if you ignore or dismiss it — dismissing it just hides it for a week (see browser storage above). The link opens an external payment service (Buy Me a Coffee) in a new tab; no third-party scripts or trackers are loaded inside Point Taken itself, but once you follow that link you are on their site, subject to their own privacy practices."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:201
msgid "Point Taken is free to use for teams and individuals. It is offered as-is, without warranty of any kind: while it is built and maintained with care, availability, data retention, and fitness for any particular purpose are not guaranteed. Please don’t rely on a room as a system of record — export or note down estimates you need to keep, since rooms expire."
msgstr "Point Taken is free to use for teams and individuals. It is offered as-is, without warranty of any kind: while it is built and maintained with care, availability, data retention, and fitness for any particular purpose are not guaranteed. Please don’t rely on a room as a system of record — export or note down estimates you need to keep, since rooms expire."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:238
msgid "Point Taken is made by <0>xexio.dev</0>, an independent developer based in Spain, and is not affiliated with any company. For any privacy question or request, contact me at <1>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</1>."
msgstr "Point Taken is made by <0>xexio.dev</0>, an independent developer based in Spain, and is not affiliated with any company. For any privacy question or request, contact me at <1>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</1>."

#: src/components/PrivacyPage.jsx:84
